IMAPAccount gmail
Host imap.gmail.com
Port 993
TLSType IMAPS
CertificateFile /etc/ssl/cert.pem
User leoaparisi@gmail.com
PassCmd "pass leoaparisi@gmail.com"

IMAPStore gmail-remote
Account gmail

MaildirStore gmail-local
Path ~/.local/share/mail/leoaparisi@gmail.com/
Inbox ~/.local/share/mail/leoaparisi@gmail.com/INBOX
SubFolders Verbatim

Channel gmail
Far :gmail-remote:
Near :gmail-local:
Patterns *
Create Both
Expunge Both
SyncState *
